{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559923408,"sessionID":"ses_e2be9abf0ffea6S3OJ4PZfZtpb","part":{"id":"prt_1d41b450a002fJP8MRXb1qtih8","sessionID":"ses_e2be9abf0ffea6S3OJ4PZfZtpb","messageID":"msg_1d41b359c001hoyhuB1d0MYcep","type":"text","text":"T007 is complete. Both verify commands pass.\n\n## Files written\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs`**\n- Added a guard in `compose` after the router action and mirror action are decided: when either path is a symlink and its action is `create`, `replace` or `remove`, it throws `PreconditionError` with `<path> is a symlink to <target>, and writing through it would change the file it points at`.\n- Rewrote the comment above the root-document check so it names all three written paths: root document, router, Cursor mirror.\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs`**\n- Added three cases: symlinked Cursor mirror refused with target untouched, symlinked router that would gain rows refused, and symlinked router the run would leave alone not refused (listed `unchanged`).\n\n## Verify output\n\nTest-first run, before the implementation (2 failed as specified, third passed):\n\n```\n✖ a symlinked Cursor mirror is refused and its target is untouched\n✖ a symlinked router that would gain rows is refused\n✔ a symlinked router the run would leave alone is not refused\n0 !== 2\n```\n\nAfter the implementation, `node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs` (exit 0):\n\n```\nℹ tests 42\nℹ pass 42\nℹ fail 0\nℹ duration_ms 14541.506792\n```\n\nProbe `bash specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/scratch/planning/probe-mirror-link.sh`:\n\n```\n[agents-md-embed] ERROR: .cursor/rules/repo-local.md is a symlink to ../../.github/ci.yml, and writing through it would change the file it points at\nplan exit=2\nci.yml sha before=b8ae3686e91b after=b8ae3686e91b link still a link: yes\n```\n\n`node --check` passes on both files. `tasks.md` was not modified, so the T007 checkbox remains unticked, and nothing was committed.\n\nNote for the orchestrator: both files already carried uncommitted work from the sibling T004–T006 tasks when I started. I only added my own hunks and left the other changes intact.","time":{"start":1794559919370,"end":1794559923408}}}
